    "description": "Bejamas pairs a pale gray editorial canvas with black, image-led hero bands and a single acid-lime conversion color. Neue Montreal carries nearly everything: oversized light-weight display copy feels direct and spacious, while medium-weight supporting copy and navigation keep the interface grounded. Content moves between large, dark photographic panels, restrained white and gray work grids, hairline divisions, and rounded project tiles rather than shadowed containers.",
